  <h2>Why this project exists</h2>
  <p>A convincing demo can hide a fragile workflow. Teams need a practical way to ask specific questions: did the task complete, were the rules respected, and what evidence supports the answer?</p>
  <p>ArtemisKit turns those questions into reviewable tests. Its open-source foundation makes the mechanics available for inspection, independent use and contribution.</p>
