  <h2>What do we stand for?</h2>
  <ul><li><strong>Inspectability:</strong> keep requirements, methods and evidence understandable.</li><li><strong>Scope:</strong> test a defined question and state what remains unknown.</li><li><strong>Human responsibility:</strong> keep consequential decisions with authorised people.</li><li><strong>Useful participation:</strong> welcome better scenarios, documentation, code and challenge.</li></ul>
